    "updated_at": "2021-02-11T16:10:09Z",
    "body": "We had a conversation with the CSS WG and CSS Typed OM is very close to have a Color type. Given that, we are working on modifying this to simply support the Typed OM color type described here: https://drafts.css-houdini.org/css-typed-om-1/#colorvalue-objects",
