    "body": "> ISSUE 6 TODO add stringifiers\r\n\r\nYou're referring to [CSSColorValue](https://drafts.css-houdini.org/css-typed-om-1/#colorvalue-objects) objects themselves? From the perspective of Canvas2D style input they definitely don't need to stringify.",
