    "updated_at": "2021-05-18T12:34:10Z",
    "body": "I think you might be missing my point? I'm saying that if they will stringify I see less of a need to accept them directly as in most cases you cannot tell the difference. Implementations could optimize those cases where there is no difference if they wanted to.",
